# Cursor Rules for ItWork Project

## Hot Reload MCP Server
Always use the hotreload MCP server for hot reload operations. When making code changes that require hot reloading:
- Use the hotreload MCP server tools to trigger reloads
- Check status using hotreload MCP server status tools
- Read logs using hotreload MCP server log tools
- Prefer using `mcp_hot-reload_hot_reload_trigger_and_wait` for automated reload workflows
